flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> O[Open Learning page]
    O --> C[Select chapter]
    C --> L[Select lesson]
    L --> R[Read lesson]
    R --> A{Learner action?}
    A -->|Complete lesson| SV[Save completion to database]
    SV --> LAST{Last lesson?}
    LAST -->|No| NX[Open next lesson or chapter]
    NX --> R
    LAST -->|Yes| BK[/Display Learning page with updated progress/]
    BK --> E([End])
    A -->|Next or Previous Lesson| NP[Open that lesson]
    NP --> R
    A -->|Back to Chapter| L
    A -->|Leave Learning| E
